WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.960
-Good luck.
-Thank you.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.400
Where have you been?

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.120
Oh, hold up at the chateau

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.160
copulating with
a young woman named Faith.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.560
It's ironic, isn't it?

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.440
You little devil.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.400
Why?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.040
-I dropped something.
-Oh, I'm sure you did.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.360
Well, if you're going to be
cruel about it…

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.880
Don't be coming to me
for any favours.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:13.240
Detective Douche is a
real joy to be around today.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.400
I may know
the answer to that.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.120
Another one bites the dust.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.960
Miss Lopez, are you alright?

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.240
I can see why he had

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.280
such a meteoric rise
in the biz.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.840
Obviously the man was
a tremendous talent.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:34.800
Thank you.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.920
Turn the music down, sir.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.480
You should refrain from
arguing in front of the kid.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.440
It's unbecoming.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.560
So, you can see why
I'm having a hard time

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.840
accepting your confidence
in Miss Hodder's confession

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.680
when, in fact,
your men are still out there

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.200
looking for Miss Stangaurd
to kill her.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.040
Yes, well.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.760
Satan, Beelzebub,

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.280
Old Scratch…

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.440
Actually, I like that one
in particular.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.320
But those were the old me.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.280
These days you just have
plain old Lucifer.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.040
You've got to admit

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.960
you've been a bit of
a selfish king,

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.800
keeping the whole
Earth thing to yourself.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.400
Give me my son!

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.880
Over my dead body.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.640
That's right.
It's already dead.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:18.720
Not you.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.600
Risen perfectly,
just as you like them.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.040
You…
don't seem too bothered

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.800
by my being
the prince of darkness.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.560
I'm willing to work
within your metaphor.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:06.960
Right.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Oh.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.520
-It's beautiful.
-Oh, it's…

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.440
What is it?

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.640
It's the bullet.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.560
From when you shot me,
remember?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.400
In the warehouse,
early in our partnership.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.400
Oh.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.200
Yeah.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.480
I remember.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.080
I thought since I'll…

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:47.160
never likely penetrate you,

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.320
I'd commemorate the one
time you penetrated me.

